# Quantumult X filter list
# Capture-verified WeChat advertising media hosts.
# wx*.wxs.qq.com: mini-program advertising media.
# *.ssad.qq.com below: native social advertising images and video observed in
# the 2026-08-22 WeChat capture. Keep these as exact hosts; the wider WeChat
# transport and content CDNs also carry normal articles, comments, and media.
# These are exact hosts; do not broaden them to wxs.qq.com, ssad.qq.com or
# qq.com.

host, wxsmw.wxs.qq.com, reject
host, wximg.wxs.qq.com, reject
host, img.ssad.qq.com, reject
host, smw.ssad.qq.com, reject
